%% status: current (solid = implemented, dashed = proposed)
%% title: Submission, read-back and unknown outcome handling
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Prepared
  Prepared --> Signed: wallet signature exists
  Signed --> Submitted: network accepted for inclusion
  Submitted --> Confirmed: read back by hash and successful
  Confirmed --> Reconciled: matches the approved batch
  Confirmed --> ReconciliationRequired: any mismatch
  Submitted --> UnknownOutcome: NOT_FOUND or timeout
  UnknownOutcome --> Confirmed: original hash read later
  UnknownOutcome --> Failed: original hash read, failed
  Signed --> Expired: entry lifetime passed
  Reconciled --> [*]
  ReconciliationRequired --> [*]
  Failed --> [*]
  Expired --> [*]
